    {
      "id": "f-meta-nav-mesh-path-180ef9",
      "name": "FMetaNavMeshPath",
      "category": "MetaNavMeshPath",
      "signature": "FMetaNavMeshPath()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "FMetaNavMeshPath allows creating hierarchical or guided navmesh paths\nWaypoints array defines list of locations that will be used to create actual FNavMeshPath data during path following.\nOn path following start and upon reaching waypoint, path will request update from owning navmesh with following parameters:\n- start location set to agent location\n- end location set to target waypoint (or goal actor for last one)\n- goal actor set only for last section\nSince path updates itself for moving agent it really shouldn't be reused by others."
    },
    {
